{"ticker":"LOW","updated":"2026-10-30T22:57:10Z","profile":{"longName":"Lowe's Companies, Inc.","shortName":"Lowe's Companies, Inc.","sector":"Consumer Cyclical","industry":"Home Improvement Retail","country":"United States","website":"https://corporate.lowes.com","fullTimeEmployees":300000,"marketCap":117299568640,"trailingPE":17.672867,"forwardPE":16.09972,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":1.2971025,"pegRatio":1.32,"targetMeanPrice":251.9697,"targetHighPrice":300.0,"targetLowPrice":191.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":33,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.083,"earningsGrowth":0.0,"grossMargins":0.32994,"operatingMargins":0.13365,"profitMargins":0.073460005,"totalRevenue":90431995904,"beta":0.878,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":293.06,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":178.45,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":2.41},"summary":"Lowe's Companies, Inc., together with its subsidiaries, operates as a home improvement retailer in the United States and Canada. It provides a line of products for construction, maintenance, repair, remodeling, and decorating. The company also offers home improvement products, such as appliances, seasonal and outdoor living, lumber, lawn and garden, kitchens and bath, hardware, building materials, millwork, paint, rough plumbing, tools, electrical, flooring, and décor. In addition, it provides installation services through independent contractors in various product categories; and extended protection plans and repair services. Further, the company provides design, distribution, and installation services for interior surface finishes to home builders and property managers. It sells its national brand-name merchandise and private brand products to professional customers, individual homeowners, and renters. The company serves its products through Lowes.com website, mobile applications, retail home improvement stores and outlet stores, and its branches. Lowe's Companies, Inc. was founded in 1921 and is based in Mooresville, North Carolina.","summary_zh":"Lowe's Companies, Inc. 及其子公司在美國和加拿大以家居裝修零售商經營。它提供一系列用於建築、維護、修理、改造和裝飾的產品。該公司還提供家居裝修產品，如電器、季節性和戶外生活、木材、草坪和花園、廚房和浴室、五金製品、建築材料、木製品、油漆、粗糙管道、工具、電氣、地板和裝飾。此外，它還透過獨立承包商提供各種產品類別的安裝服務；以及擴展的保護計劃和維修服務。此外，該公司還為住宅建築商和物業經理提供室內表面飾面的設計、分銷和安裝服務。它向專業客戶、個人業主和租戶銷售其國家名牌商品和自有品牌產品。該公司透過 Lowes.com 網站、行動應用程式、零售家居裝修商店和直銷店及其分店提供產品服務。 Lowe's Companies, Inc. 成立於 1921 年，總部位於北卡羅來納州穆爾斯維爾。","sector_zh":"週期性消費","industry_zh":"家居裝修零售","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":256.45,"h":259.01,"l":255.61,"c":258.74,"v":1783700},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":257.45,"h":261.39,"l":257.0,"c":260.68,"v":2002400},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":263.04,"h":264.71,"l":261.47,"c":264.57,"v":2258700},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":267.37,"h":270.68,"l":265.23,"c":269.97,"v":4488200},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":269.21,"h":273.22,"l":268.68,"c":273.02,"v":4464800},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":272.28,"h":272.28,"l":267.6,"c":269.03,"v":3120500},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":268.41,"h":269.0,"l":265.08,"c":266.55,"v":1918300},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":267.84,"h":273.41,"l":267.21,"c":272.4,"v":2253400},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":270.06,"h":272.6,"l":269.53,"c":271.83,"v":2906300},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":271.48,"h":272.65,"l":269.1,"c":272.09,"v":2648100},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":272.93,"h":273.27,"l":269.41,"c":270.52,"v":1940700},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":272.6,"h":274.98,"l":266.86,"c":267.95,"v":2854600},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":269.07,"h":270.57,"l":267.49,"c":267.57,"v":2301700},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":267.53,"h":267.63,"l":265.11,"c":265.2,"v":4079000},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":265.0,"h":265.41,"l":260.36,"c":260.39,"v":3435300},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":259.56,"h":260.78,"l":257.25,"c":259.81,"v":2972900},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":258.29,"h":259.51,"l":256.34,"c":257.33,"v":3156000},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":254.92,"h":257.43,"l":254.17,"c":255.53,"v":2877900},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":255.61,"h":257.69,"l":254.2,"c":257.12,"v":1923600},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":257.13,"h":257.33,"l":250.73,"c":253.32,"v":3282100},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":252.81,"h":253.6,"l":249.63,"c":251.31,"v":3114400},{"t":"2